WEBVTT

00:00:00.351 --> 00:00:08.153
Three cards wait for the owner. Two bring work to approve: a demo and a review. They are framed in orange, with an exclamation mark on the pin.

00:00:09.105 --> 00:00:24.047
The third card has a question from its agent. It is dark yellow instead: its frame, its top line, and its pin, which shows a question mark. Its state line, Question for you, has a question mark icon too. So a question is easy to tell apart from work to approve.

00:00:25.001 --> 00:00:29.541
Opened, the card shows the same state in the same colour, with the question mark in front.

00:00:30.495 --> 00:00:35.255
In the light theme, the yellow is a darker shade, so it stays legible on the pale card.

00:00:36.210 --> 00:00:43.315
So questions for you now read at a glance, in dark yellow with a question mark, on the canvas, in the minimap and in the open card.
